# Design System

## Philosophy
Clean, minimal, white-first. Color is used sparingly — violet for interactive/active states only, zinc grays for everything structural. If you're reaching for a color that isn't in this palette, stop and use a gray instead.

---

## Color Palette

### Base
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `white` | `#FFFFFF` | Main content background |
| `zinc-50` | `#FAFAFA` | Sidebar, topbar, status bar backgrounds |
| `zinc-100` | `#F4F4F5` | Hover states, file icon backgrounds |
| `zinc-200` | `#E4E4E7` | Borders, dividers |
| `zinc-400` | `#A1A1AA` | Secondary text, inactive sidebar items, placeholder |
| `zinc-300` | `#D4D4D8` | Tertiary text, metadata, breadcrumb separators |
| `zinc-900` | `#18181B` | Primary text, active file names, headings |

### Accent — Violet
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `violet-50` | `#F3F0FF` | Active sidebar item bg, folder icon bg, pill/badge bg |
| `violet-200` | `#DDD6FE` | Violet borders, focus rings |
| `violet-700` | `#7C3AED` | Primary buttons, active text, folder icons, pills |
| `violet-800` | `#5B21B6` | Button hover state |
| `violet-950` | `#3B0764` | Button active/pressed state |

### Semantic
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `green-500` | `#22C55E` | Connected status dot |
| `red-500` | `#EF4444` | Error, disconnected status |
| `amber-500` | `#F59E0B` | Warning, syncing status |

---

## Tailwind Config

Define these in `tailwind.config.ts` — never hardcode hex values in components:

```ts
// tailwind.config.ts
import type { Config } from "tailwindcss";

export default {
  content: ["./src/**/*.{ts,tsx}"],
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        accent: {
          50:  "#F3F0FF",
          200: "#DDD6FE",
          700: "#7C3AED",
          800: "#5B21B6",
          950: "#3B0764",
        },
      },
      borderColor: {
        DEFAULT: "#E4E4E7",
      },
    },
  },
} satisfies Config;
```

---

## Component Patterns

### Backgrounds
```
Page / main content     bg-white
Sidebar / topbar        bg-zinc-50
Hover row / pressed     bg-zinc-100
Active sidebar item     bg-accent-50
```

### Borders
```
All borders             border-zinc-200   (0.5px — use border-[0.5px])
Focused input           border-accent-200 + ring-2 ring-accent-200/40
```

### Text
```
Primary (filenames, headings)   text-zinc-900
Secondary (labels, metadata)    text-zinc-400
Tertiary (hints, breadcrumbs)   text-zinc-300
Active / accent                 text-accent-700
```

### Buttons

Primary (upload, confirm):
```tsx
<button className="bg-accent-700 hover:bg-accent-800 active:bg-accent-950 text-white text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors">
  Upload
</button>
```

Ghost (secondary actions):
```tsx
<button className="bg-white hover:bg-zinc-50 border border-[0.5px] border-zinc-200 text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-600 text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors">
  New folder
</button>
```

Danger:
```tsx
<button className="bg-white hover:bg-red-50 border border-[0.5px] border-zinc-200 hover:border-red-200 text-zinc-400 hover:text-red-500 text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md transition-colors">
  Delete
</button>
```

### File / Folder Rows
```tsx
<div className="flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-zinc-100 cursor-pointer group">
  {/* Folder icon wrapper */}
  <div className="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-accent-50 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
    <FolderIcon className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-accent-700" />
  </div>
  {/* File icon wrapper */}
  <div className="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
    <FileIcon className="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-zinc-300" />
  </div>
  <span className="flex-1 text-xs text-zinc-900 truncate">filename.mp3</span>
  <span className="text-xs text-zinc-300 tabular-nums">2.4 MB</span>
</div>
```

### Sidebar Items
```tsx
// Active
<div className="flex items-center gap-2 mx-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-accent-50 text-accent-700 text-xs cursor-pointer">

// Inactive
<div className="flex items-center gap-2 mx-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-zinc-400 hover:bg-zinc-100 hover:text-zinc-600 text-xs cursor-pointer transition-colors">
```

### Badges / Pills
```tsx
// File count pill on folders
<span className="bg-accent-50 text-accent-700 text-[10px] font-medium px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">
  48 files
</span>

// Status badge
<span className="bg-green-50 text-green-600 text-[10px] font-medium px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">
  Connected
</span>
```

### Status Bar
```tsx
<div className="bg-zinc-50 border-t border-[0.5px] border-zinc-200 h-7 px-3 flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[11px] text-zinc-300">
  <div className="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 flex-shrink-0" />
  <span>Connected</span>
  <span className="ml-auto tabular-nums">148 MB · 62 files</span>
</div>
```

### Inputs / Forms
```tsx
<input className="w-full bg-white border border-[0.5px] border-zinc-200 rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-xs text-zinc-900 placeholder:text-zinc-300 focus:outline-none focus:border-accent-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent-200/40 transition-colors" />
```

### Section Labels (sidebar)
```tsx
<p className="text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-zinc-300 px-3 pt-3 pb-1">
  Connections
</p>
```

---

## Border Width

Always use `border-[0.5px]` not `border` (which is 1px). The thinner border is core to the refined feel.

```tsx
// GOOD
<div className="border-[0.5px] border-zinc-200">

// BAD
<div className="border border-zinc-200">
```

---

## Typography

| Use | Class |
|---|---|
| Page heading | `text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900` |
| Section label | `text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-zinc-300` |
| Body / filenames | `text-xs text-zinc-900` |
| Secondary labels | `text-xs text-zinc-400` |
| Metadata / hints | `text-[11px] text-zinc-300` |

No font sizes below 10px. No font-weight above 600.

---

## Spacing & Radius

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `rounded-md` | 6px | Buttons, inputs, icon wrappers, badges |
| `rounded-lg` | 8px | File rows, sidebar items |
| `rounded-xl` | 12px | Cards, modals, panels |

Sidebar width: `w-44` (176px). Topbar / status bar height: `h-10` / `h-7`.

---

## Do Not

- Do not use any color outside this palette without explicit approval
- Do not use `border` (1px) — always `border-[0.5px]`
- Do not add gradients, shadows (`shadow-*`), or blur effects
- Do not use font-bold (700) — max is font-semibold (600) for labels, font-medium (500) for headings
- Do not use violet for anything other than interactive/active states — structural elements are always zinc
- Do not use more than one accent color — violet is the only accent
